{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13774","headline":"剡纸歌 · 顾况","name":"剡纸歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云门路上山阴雪，中有玉人持玉节。\n宛委山里禹余粮，石中黄子黄金屑。\n剡溪剡纸生剡藤，喷水捣後爲蕉叶。\n欲写金人金口经，寄与山阴山里僧。\n手把山中紫罗笔，思量点画龙蛇出。\n政是垂头蹋翼时，不免向君求此物。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}